+---
+id: task-003-fix-welcome-coupon-not-returned-on-cancel-check-free-shipping-at-exactly-50-euros
+type: task
+title: "Fix welcome coupon not returned on cancel; check free shipping at exactly 50 euros"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+## What was done
+
+1. Welcome code refused after cancel: `OrderService.cancel` gave the coupon back under the customer id,
+   while `Coupons` records the using order's id, so the single-use coupon was never released. It now
+   passes the order id. Test added in `test/orders.test.ts`.
+2. €4.90 shipping on €50.00 goods: the current code already ships free from 5000 cents (fixed earlier in
+   74a0a09, task-001). Added a characterization test for exactly €50.00. If the complaint is recent, the
+   order was probably priced before that fix; nothing more to change in the code.
